            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुष्टी करणे — puṣṭī karṇe — \"to confirm\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पोलिसांनी अपघाताची पुष्टी केली. polisānnī apghātācī puṣṭī kelī. The police confirmed the accident."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने पुष्टी केली, tyāne puṣṭī kelī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुष्टी is feminine, so the past is केली."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुष्टी करणे (puṣṭī karṇe) joins the tatsama पुष्टी, Sanskrit puṣṭi, \"growth, thriving\" (Monier-Williams), to करणे, \"to make\": to strengthen a report until it is sure."
            }
